WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Standing heavy kick Punish Counters from the recorded near-corner spacing.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.500
Standing heavy punch cancels into Level 2, sending Ryu toward the wall.

3
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.300
Raw Rush crouching heavy punch and medium Flash Axe pick up the wall rebound.

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.900
Prowler medium punch and heavy Knee Smash complete the corner knockdown.
